#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:5 cec7e738ec1640b7a169ab3a14974687
msgid "Introducing Copter"
msgstr "ArduCopter简介"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:7 3f3d986d1d8c49c38ef781d269acb74a
msgid ""
"Copter is an advanced open-source autopilot system for multicopters, "
":ref:`traditional single/dual rotor helicopters <traditional-helicopters>`, "
"and other rotor vehicles.  It offers a :ref:`wide variety of flight modes "
"<flight-modes>` from fully manual to fully autonomous."
msgstr ""
"ArduCopter是一款先进的开源飞控系统，适用于多旋翼、:ref:`传统单/双旋翼直升机 <traditional-helicopters>` "
"及其他旋翼飞行器。它提供 :ref:`多种飞行模式 <flight-modes>`，从全手动到全自主皆可。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:12 185cb8eb574c4b0eadda2745dfc00510
msgid ""
"As part of the wider ArduPilot software platform it works seamlessly with a "
"variety of :ref:`Ground Control Station programs <common-choosing-a-ground-"
"station>` that are used to setup the vehicle, monitor the vehicle's flight "
"in real-time and perform powerful mission planning activities. It also "
"benefits from other parts of the ArduPilot ecosystem, including simulators, "
"log analysis tools, and higher level APIs for vehicle control."
msgstr ""
"作为更广泛的ArduPilot软件平台的一部分，它与多种 :ref:`地面站程序 <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`"
" "
"无缝集成，这些程序用于配置飞行器、实时监控飞行状态以及执行强大的任务规划活动。它还受益于ArduPilot生态系统的其他组成部分，包括模拟器、日志分析工具以及用于飞行器控制的高级API。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:16 b8fe749186ec465d88976e8f07d5dcec
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is already a preferred platform for numerous commercially "
"available autopilot systems but you can also use it to enhance the abilities"
" of your own DIY multirotor."
msgstr "ArduPilot已是众多商业飞控系统的首选平台，同时您也可以用它来提升您自制多旋翼的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:19 47547f0e1b61441d9e6e51fde9fbdd8b
msgid "Key features"
msgstr "主要功能"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:21 289be3bebf0d4ecc8d0215b5808c2ad5
msgid "Key features include:"
msgstr "主要功能包括："

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:23 9f0656f481bc4073b4e21442df06fa8b
msgid ""
"High precision :ref:`acrobatic mode <acro-mode>`: perform aggressive "
"maneuvers including flips!"
msgstr "高精度 :ref:`特技模式 <acro-mode>`：可执行包括翻转在内的激进机动动作！"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:24 c8a79f6743c947179327918edf85effa
msgid ""
":ref:`Auto-level <stabilize-mode>` and :ref:`Altitude Hold <altholdmode>` "
"modes: Fly level and straight with ease or add :ref:`simple <simpleandsuper-"
"simple-modes>` mode which removes the need for the pilot to keep track of "
"the vehicle's heading. Just push the stick the way you want the vehicle to "
"go, and the autopilot figures out what that means for whatever orientation "
"the copter is in."
msgstr ""
":ref:`自动水平 <stabilize-mode>` 和 :ref:`定高 <altholdmode>` 模式：轻松实现平稳飞行，或启用 "
":ref:`简单 <simpleandsuper-simple-modes>` "
"模式，使飞手无需追踪飞行器航向。只需将摇杆推向您希望飞行器前进的方向，飞控会自动计算出在当前任意机头朝向下的对应操控指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:25 3fafe701e29947339992325e15802c2d
msgid ""
":ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` and :ref:`PosHold <poshold-mode>` modes: the "
"vehicle will hold its position using its GPS, accelerometers and barometer."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`PosHold <poshold-mode>` "
"模式：飞行器将利用GPS、加速度计和气压计保持当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:26 17a99b3b95d546fe8c81390131a2906e
msgid ""
":ref:`Return to launch <rtl-mode>`: Flip a switch to have Copter fly back to"
" the launch location and land automatically."
msgstr ":ref:`返航 <rtl-mode>`：拨动一个开关，ArduCopter即可自动飞回起飞位置并自动降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:27 faa7505fe2154a24acedf6714339ae6c
msgid ""
":ref:`Ad-hoc commands in Flight <ac2_guidedmode>`: With a two-way telemetry "
"radio installed, just click on the map and the vehicle will fly to the "
"desired location."
msgstr ":ref:`飞行中临时指令 <ac2_guidedmode>`：安装双向数传电台后，只需在地图上点击，飞行器即可飞往目标位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:28 e27318f4950c431fa2fe1b3ef400c2bc
msgid ""
":ref:`Autonomous missions <auto-mode>`: Use the ground station to define "
"complex missions with up to hundreds of GPS waypoints.  Then switch the "
"vehicle to \"AUTO\" and watch it take-off, execute the mission, then return "
"home, land and disarm all without any human intervention."
msgstr ""
":ref:`自主任务 <auto-"
"mode>`：使用地面站规划包含数百个GPS航点的复杂任务，然后将飞行器切换至\"AUTO\"模式，观看它自动起飞、执行任务、返航、降落并上锁，全程无需人工干预。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:29 e97f4a95a6b042829ddeb5f5be177740
msgid ""
":ref:`Failsafes <failsafe-landing-page>`: The software monitors the state of"
" the system and triggers an autonomous return-to-home in case of loss of "
"contact with the pilot, low battery, or the vehicle strays outside a defined"
" geofence."
msgstr ""
":ref:`失控保护 <failsafe-landing-"
"page>`：软件持续监控系统状态，在失去与飞手的联系、电池电量不足或飞行器超出规定围栏范围时，自动触发自主返航。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:30 3fd10bab6a9746f19d7cbab890ffd53c
msgid ""
"**Flexible and customizable**: Copter can fly :ref:`all shapes and sizes of "
"vehicles <common-all-vehicle-types>` just how you want it to because the "
"user has access to hundreds of parameters that control its behaviour.  You "
"won't need to touch most of them but they are there if you need them."
msgstr ""
"**灵活可定制**：ArduCopter可按您的意愿飞行 :ref:`各种形状和尺寸的飞行器 <common-all-vehicle-"
"types>`，因为用户可访问数百个控制行为的参数。您不需要修改其中大部分参数，但在需要时它们随时可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:31 5f78f7c302c34b62b2b585ed69701530
msgid ""
"**No vendor lock-in**: ArduPilot is fully open source with a diverse "
"community of developers behind it.  You remain in full control of what "
"software is on your vehicle and how it performs."
msgstr "**无厂商锁定**：ArduPilot是完全开源的，背后有多元化的开发者社区支持。您对飞行器上运行的软件及其性能拥有完全的控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:34 b0296bc7e476424ab39d9f1c7483403e
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "入门"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:36 ba300d8b8efd41a49237141a5f64b687
msgid ""
"The first thing that you will need is a multicopter with an :ref:`ArduPilot "
"compatible autopilot <common-autopilots>`. Here is a list of :ref:`ready-to-"
"fly vehicles <common-rtf>` to get started with quickly or you may choose to "
"build your own."
msgstr ""
"首先您需要一架配备 :ref:`ArduPilot兼容飞控 <common-autopilots>` 的多旋翼飞行器。这里有一份 "
":ref:`即飞型飞行器 <common-rtf>` 清单供您快速入手，您也可以选择自行组装。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:39 b44587988d814caf8a2a3fc3c89110f3
msgid ""
"If you're using Copter on a :ref:`ready-to-fly vehicle <common-rtf>` then it"
" should come pre-configured and tuned, ready for your first flight. We "
"recommend you read the manufacturer's instructions before flying especially "
"the sections concerning safety. Then after :ref:`installing the ground "
"station <common-install-gcs>` you can likely jump forward to the :ref:`First"
" Flight <flying-arducopter>` instructions."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是 :ref:`即飞型飞行器 <common-"
"rtf>`，它应已预先配置并调参完毕，可直接进行首飞。我们建议您在飞行前阅读制造商说明书，尤其是有关安全的章节。然后在 :ref:`安装地面站 "
"<common-install-gcs>` 后，您可以直接跳到 :ref:`首次飞行 <flying-arducopter>` 说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:45 bbedc4941ca449d390c43433de967c3b
msgid ""
"Whether using an RTF or DIY vehicle, autonomous vehicles are potentially "
"dangerous! Always follow :ref:`best safety practices <safety-multicopter>` "
"and pay close attention to all safety warnings."
msgstr ""
"无论使用即飞型还是自制飞行器，自主飞行器均存在潜在危险！请始终遵循 :ref:`最佳安全规范 <safety-multicopter>` "
"并密切关注所有安全警告。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:49 36f3c21ae95e4a76919eeb17ea025f09
msgid ""
"If you plan on building your own multicopter, the following pages will get "
"you started. Please start by reading this section in order to understand "
"what a multicopter can do, and how to select a frame, autopilot board, and "
"other essential components. Then proceed to :ref:`First Time Setup <initial-"
"setup>` to learn how to assemble your Copter and then :ref:`First Flight "
"<flying-arducopter>` to learn how to configure and tune it."
msgstr ""
"如果您计划自行组装多旋翼，以下页面将帮助您入门。请先阅读本节，了解多旋翼的功能以及如何选择机架、飞控板和其他必要组件。然后前往 :ref:`首次设置 "
"<initial-setup>` 学习如何组装ArduCopter，再前往 :ref:`首次飞行 <flying-arducopter>` "
"学习如何配置和调参。"
